        <technology>
            <technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses xml:lang="en">Average installed technology.\n\n# Included processes\nElectricity output at busbar. The module uses an average net efficiency of Chinese small coal power plants at coal mines at the end of the 1990s (nearly 13%).</technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses>
